## 4. LONG PRESS & REPLY INTERACTION FLOW

**MessageLongPressWrapper** (`src/screens/room/fragments/message-long-press-wrapper/MessageLongPressWrapper.tsx`):
- Only wraps messages where `event.canBeRepliedTo` is true (line 48)
